>> [duplicate]: ref
>> servings: 1

Put @bread{2%slices} in the #toaster.

In a #pan, melt @butter{20%g} on medium-high heat.

Crack @eggs{2} into the pan. Add @salt and @pepper.

Spread @butter{10%g} onto the toast.

Once the eggs are cooked through, use a #spatula to put the eggs onto the toast.

